    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about the mask though. it's the constant noise of trying to understand why everyone else finds it so easy. it's like i'm built differently and there's no patch for it. it's just... so much effort just to exist. sometimes i look at people and think they're just so peaceful because they belong, and i'm just perpetually tired.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
